## over its rig's defaults. Only proportions, palette and gear vary; the rig
## gives the family its shared shape language and motion.
##
## Palettes follow the art direction: forest = greens / earthy browns,
## labyrinth = teal-grey, overgrowth = saturated greens, desert = ochre,
## ice = cyan / white, volcano = black / red / orange glow, hell = purple /
## crimson. Glowing eyes are kept for the uncanny (undead, demons, spirits,
## bosses); animals have dark eyes with a glint.

